# Windows NDI runtime DLL (Processing.NDI.Lib.x64.dll, ~28.5 MB): not
# committed, same policy as libndi.so.6 in the AppImage build and the
# vcpkg-sourced projectM DLLs (Step 12): copied at package time from the
# NDI SDK installed on the Windows build machine
# (C:\Program Files\NDI\NDI 6 SDK\Bin\x64\Processing.NDI.Lib.x64.dll).
# See .superpowers/sdd/PHASE6-PACKAGING.PLAN/task-13-report.md.
/packaging/windows/Processing.NDI.Lib.x64.dll

# Windows portable zip packaging build artifacts (regenerated by
